---
export const prerender = true;
import '../styles/global.css';
import syne800 from '@fontsource/syne/files/syne-latin-800-normal.woff2?url';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Terms · 3DreamLab</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Terms for the invite-only 3DreamLab Edge preview: access, limits, paid tiers, your responsibilities, and liability."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://3dreamlab.com/terms/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32" />
    <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href={syne800} crossorigin />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="legal">
      <a class="legal__logo" href="/">3DREAMLAB</a>

      <div class="legal__inner">
        <h1 class="legal__title">TERMS<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
        <p class="legal__meta">LAST UPDATED 2026-10-19 · VERSION 1 · PREVIEW</p>

        <div class="legal__body">
          <p>
            These terms apply to the 3DreamLab Edge preview, an invite-only, free-of-charge trial of an edge caching
            service (a proxy that caches responses from your own API at edge.3dreamlab.com).
          </p>

          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            The service is provided by a Finnish entity. Contact:
            <a href="mailto:contact@3dreamlab.com">contact@3dreamlab.com</a>.
          </p>

          <h2>The preview</h2>
          <p>
            Access is invite-only. You may use the preview only after we manually approve your request. We may decline
            any request without giving a reason.
          </p>
          <p>
            The service is for businesses and professionals only. By requesting access you confirm that you act for a
            business, not as a consumer.
          </p>

          <h2>Free preview, no SLA</h2>
          <p>
            The preview is free of charge. It is provided “as is”, on a best-effort basis. We do not guarantee uptime or
            performance. Features and limits may change. Current Free tier limits: 1,000 requests per day, 1 project,
            1 origin, 3 cache rules and 3 purges per day.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you exceed the daily request limit, responses at edge.3dreamlab.com may return HTTP 429. Your own
            site or API is not affected.
          </p>

          <h2>Paid tiers</h2>
          <p>
            Starter (€99/month) and Pro (€299/month) are available only on request, after a separate written agreement
            and a manual invoice. VAT may be added. Nothing is charged automatically, and there is no card payment on
            this site. Paid tiers are governed by that separate agreement; where it conflicts with these terms, the
            separate agreement prevails.
          </p>

          <h2>Your responsibilities</h2>
          <p>
            You must own or be authorized to use the origin URL you connect. We require proof via a DNS TXT record
            or a file at <code>/.well-known</code> on that origin.
          </p>
          <p>You must not use the service to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>host or proxy unlawful content;</li>
            <li>attack or overload third parties;</li>
            <li>proxy content you have no right to serve;</li>
            <li>try to access other customers' data.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Your email is your login. Keep your email account secure.
          </p>

          <h2>What the edge serves</h2>
          <p>
            The edge cache serves JSON, XML, and text API responses only. The maximum response size is 1 MB. Cookies and
            Authorization headers are stripped. HTML is not served.
          </p>

          <h2>Data in your API responses</h2>
          <p>
            For the content your origin returns through the edge, you are the controller and we process it only on your
            behalf, to cache and serve it as your rules say. Cloudflare is our sub-processor. We keep it confidential,
            protect it with appropriate security measures, help you answer data subject requests where needed, and
            delete it when cached copies expire or when you delete the project. Don't route special categories of
            personal data through the preview. A separate data processing agreement is available on request.
          </p>

          <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>
            The service, console and documentation remain ours. During the preview you get a revocable, non-exclusive,
            non-transferable right to use them for evaluating the service. Your data and your API content remain yours.
          </p>

          <h2>Suspension and termination</h2>
          <p>
            We may suspend or end any account or project at any time, especially for abuse, security risk, or
            non-payment. We give notice where reasonable. You may delete your project or account at any time in Settings
            in the console.
          </p>

          <h2>Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, lost profit, or lost
            data. Our total liability for the free preview is limited to EUR 100. Nothing in these terms limits
            liability for wilful misconduct or gross negligence, or any other liability that cannot be limited under
            Finnish law.
          </p>
          <p>
            You are responsible for, and will compensate us for, third-party claims and costs that result from your
            origin content or your breach of these terms.
          </p>

          <h2>Data protection</h2>
          <p>
            How we process personal data is described in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> notice.
          </p>

          <h2>Law and disputes</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by Finnish law. Disputes are settled in the competent Finnish district
            court as the court of first instance.
          </p>

          <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>
            We post updates on this page with a new date. We email account holders about material changes at least 14
            days before they take effect; if you continue to use the service after that date, you accept the updated
            terms. If you don't agree, you can delete your account before then.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="legal__foot">
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
        <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <style>
      .legal {
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 6vh, 4rem);
        padding: 1.25rem 5vw 2rem;
        background: var(--black);
        color: var(--white);
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .legal__logo,
      .legal__meta,
      .legal__foot {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: var(--text-meta);
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      }

      .legal__logo {
        align-self: flex-start;
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: var(--text-nav);
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        padding: 0.9rem 0;
        margin: -0.9rem 0;
        color: var(--white);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .legal__inner {
        max-width: 42rem;
        border-top: 2px solid var(--white);
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      .legal__meta {
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        color: #b5b3ad;
      }

      .legal__title {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: var(--heading-lg);
        line-height: 1.05;
      }

      .legal__body {
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
        font-size: var(--text-body);
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #b5b3ad;
      }

      .legal__body p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }

      .legal__body h2 {
        margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--white);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .legal__body h2:first-of-type {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .legal__body ul {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
      }

      .legal__body li {
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      }

      .legal__body a {
        color: var(--white);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }

      .legal__body code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: var(--white);
      }

      .legal__logo:focus-visible,
      .legal__foot a:focus-visible,
      .legal__body a:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--white);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .legal__foot {
        margin-top: auto;
        color: #9a9a9a;
      }

      .legal__foot a {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.75rem 0;
        margin: -0.75rem 0;
        color: #9a9a9a;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .legal__foot a:hover {
        color: var(--white);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
